        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          { "t": "text", "v": "A type of robot chef has been given a " },
          { "t": "vocab", "v": "license", "ref": "v-license" },
          { "t": "text", "v": " in Beijing. This is the city’s first license for robot chefs." }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          { "t": "text", "v": "The robot, named Lava, " },
          { "t": "blank", "id": "b1", "number": 1, "hint": { "baseWord": "develop" } },
          { "t": "text", "v": " by EncoSmart. It is a Beijing-" },
          { "t": "vocab", "v": "based", "ref": "v-based" },
          { "t": "text", "v": " company. Lava is powered by AI. " },
          { "t": "blank", "id": "b2", "number": 2 },
          { "t": "text", "v": " other robot chefs, it can cook different types of food. It can also learn " },
          { "t": "blank", "id": "b3", "number": 3 },
          { "t": "text", "v": " its own. This allows the “chef” to improve its cooking skills over time. This way, it can keep " },
          { "t": "blank", "id": "b4", "number": 4, "hint": { "baseWord": "create" } },
          { "t": "text", "v": " new menus." }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          { "t": "text", "v": "The " },
          { "t": "gloss", "v": "first-generation", "zh": "第一代的" },
          { "t": "text", "v": " Lava robots are working in some office buildings in Beijing’s Haidian district. For now, they are only offering fried foods. Soon, another group of robot chefs " },
          { "t": "blank", "id": "b5", "number": 5, "hint": { "baseWord": "begin" } },
          { "t": "text", "v": " to work at some chain restaurants. These chefs will be able " },
          { "t": "blank", "id": "b6", "number": 6, "hint": { "baseWord": "make" } },
          { "t": "text", "v": " ice cream, drinks and salads." }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          { "t": "text", "v": "Tian Yan works " },
          { "t": "blank", "id": "b7", "number": 7 },
          { "t": "text", "v": " EncoSmart. She believes that AI is " },
          { "t": "blank", "id": "b8", "number": 8 },
          { "t": "text", "v": " unavoidable " },
          { "t": "vocab", "v": "trend", "ref": "v-trend" },
          { "t": "text", "v": " in the catering business. AI-powered robot chefs help to " },
          { "t": "vocab", "v": "reduce costs", "ref": "v-reduce-costs" },
          { "t": "text", "v": ". Besides, they can make food processing quicker and " },
          { "t": "blank", "id": "b9", "number": 9, "hint": { "baseWord": "easy" } },
          { "t": "text", "v": ". More importantly, they follow the same " },
          { "t": "gloss", "v": "standards", "zh": "标准" },
          { "t": "text", "v": " " },
          { "t": "blank", "id": "b10", "number": 10 },
          { "t": "text", "v": " they cook. This makes sure that customers’ " },
          { "t": "gloss", "v": "favored", "zh": "喜欢的" },
          { "t": "text", "v": " dishes will taste good whenever they order them." }
        ]
      },
